%>
%>I think the discussion compatibility should focus on LaTeX3, not on
%>(what should have been done with) LaTeX2e. I'm happy to accept that
%>LaTeX2e will not change, but it's (Beta-)release can start new
%>discussions on LaTeX3-issues (after all, this is called a discussion
